OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for two years after
OL,4,A'systematic and persistent' rioting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who threw missiles at police and
OL,7,Fwas part of a mob which pursued
OL,8,Fofficers while they were trying to
OL,9,Fdetain another rioter during disorder
OL,10,Fin Ballymena has been jailed for two
OL,11,Fyears.
OL,13,FAshton Thompson, of Rosses Farm in
OL,14,FBallymena, was described by the judge
OL,15,Fas having been involved in "systematic
OL,16,Fand persistent rioting" in the town in
OL,17,Fthe summer of 2025.
OL,19,FThe 21-year-old had previously pleaded
OL,20,Fguilty to rioting, stealing a wheelie
OL,21,Fbin and attempting to damage or destroy
OL,22,Fa police vehicle.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
